"og:title\" content=\"SmartAsset Alternative 2026 | Free Paycheck &amp; Tax Calculators\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A free, no-sign-up SmartAsset alternative. Paycheck, mortgage, retirement, and tax calculators for all 50 states.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/smartasset-alternative\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TheTaxCalc\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"TheTaxCalc — Free SmartAsset Alternative for 2026 Tax Calculators\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"SmartAsset Alternative 2026 | Free Tax Calculators\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"A free, no-sign-up SmartAsset alternative. Calculators for all 50 states.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><script data-cfasync=\"false\">(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-KWWRJFPZ');</script><script data-cfasync=\"false\">\n                  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n                  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n                  gtag('js', new Date());\n                  gtag('config', 'G-9SEBTKFT61');\n                </script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organizati