axcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"25\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"26\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L31\",\"27\",{}]]\n30:null\n","/smartasset-alternative/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\ne:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/49e33bee669819de.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/868a9c4503c53c54.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/d791dd6e73034ab4.js\"],\"\"]\n17:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/61cc43b3d7ad2990.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n18:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2:T117f,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/smartasset-alternative#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"SmartAsset Alternative\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/smartasset-alternative\"}]},{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/smartasset-alternative#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is TheTaxCalc really a free SmartAsset alternative?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. TheTaxCalc provides the same core calculators that SmartAsset offers — paycheck calculator, mortgage calculator, retirement calculator, tax refund estimator, and state-by-state comparisons — but every one of our tools is 100% free with no sign-up, no email requirement, and no paywall. We do not require you to create an account, and we never sell your data to financial advisors or third-party lead aggregators.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does TheTaxCalc match leads to financial advisors like SmartAsset does?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. TheTaxCalc does not operate a lead-generation business. When you use a SmartAsset calculator, the company typically asks for your contact information and matches you with up to three financial advisors who pay SmartAsset for those introductions. TheTaxCalc does not collect your income, savings, or contact details, and we never share any user information with third-party financial advisors or brokers.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which calculators does TheTaxCalc offer that compare to SmartAsset?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"TheTaxCalc offers a paycheck calculator for all 50 states, a mortgage calculator with amortization and extra payment support, a 401(k) and retirement projection calculator, a capital gains tax calculator, a self-employment tax calculator, a tax refund estimator, a home sale tax calculator, a bonus tax calculator, an overtime tax calculator, a lottery tax calculator, a sales tax calculator for all 50 states, a property tax calculator, an IRS withholding (W-4) calculator, and a state-by-state comparison tool. All are free, updated for 2026, and run entirely in your browser.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How accurate are TheTaxCalc calculators compared to SmartAsset?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Both TheTaxCalc and SmartAsset use the same primary data sources — IRS Publication 15-T for federal tax withholding, the Social Security Administration for the FICA wage base, and each state's Department of Revenue for state income tax. TheTaxCalc publishes a full methodology page documenting every source, every formula, and every assumption we use, and we update our data within 48 hours of any official IRS or state revenue department change. Our 2026 data is current as of January 2026.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does TheTaxCalc store my salary or financial information?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. All calculations on TheTaxCalc run entirely in your browser using JavaScript. Your income, deductions, savings, and tax figures are never transmitted to our servers or stored in any database. We do not require accounts, we do not use tracking cookies on calculator pages, and we cannot tie your calculation results back to you. SmartAsset and many similar lead-generation sites do collect user input — we do not.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use TheTaxCalc for actual tax filing?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Our calculators are designed for estimation, planning, and education — not for filing your actual tax return. They give you a solid starting point for understanding your take-home pay, refund expectations, and tax planning opportunities. When it's time to actually file, use IRS Free File, commercial tax preparation software, or work with a qualified CPA or Enrolled Agent who understands your full situation. We recommend our paycheck calculator and tax refund calculator as planning tools throughout the year.\"}}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"name\":\"SmartAsset Alternative 2026 — Free Paycheck & Tax Calculators\",\"description\":\"A free, no-sign-up SmartAsset alternative with paycheck, mortgage, retirement, and tax calculators for all 50 states.\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/smartasset-alternative\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"}}]}0:{\"buildId\":\"DHHyHh_Ff3S5PG3AajNLG\",\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],\"$L3\",\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\"]}],null,\"$Ld\"]}],\"loading\":null,\"isPartial\":false}\n3:[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Home\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"/\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-foreground font-medium\",\"children\":\"SmartAsset Alternative\"}]]}]\n4:[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl mb-4\",\"children\":\"The Free SmartAsset Alternative — Paycheck, Mortgage & Tax Calculators\"}]\n5:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8\",\"children\":\"SmartAsset built a popular suite of financial calculators — but they also collect your contact information, match you with up to three paying financial advisors, and require an email address before showing you full results. TheTaxCalc is a free, no-strings alternative: every calculator runs in your browser, no sign-up required, and your numbers never touch our servers. Here’s how we compare.\"}]\n6:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":\"Why Look for a SmartAsset Alternative?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":\"SmartAsset is a well-known personal finance site that publishes a paycheck calculator, a mortgage calculator, a retirement calculator, and several other tools. The site is owned by a company whose business model is lead generation: when you enter your information to use a calculator, SmartAsset typically asks for your name, email, and phone number, then matches you with up to three financial advisors who pay SmartAsset for those introductions.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":\"That’s not necessarily a bad thing — many users want advisor introductions. But if you just want to know how much you’ll take home after taxes, or whether you can afford a $400,000 mortgage, you probably don’t want your inbox flooded with advisor solicitations. TheTaxCalc was built to be the no-strings alternative: you type in your numbers, you get your answer, you leave. No accounts, no emails, no advisor matches.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The other big reason users seek an alternative is privacy. When you enter your salary, savings rate, or mortgage details into a lead-generation calculator, that data is collected, stored, and in some cases shared with third parties. On TheTaxCalc, every calculation runs entirely in your browser using JavaScript — your numbers never reach our servers. We couldn’t see them even if we wanted to.\"}]]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":\"Feature Comparison\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border/30\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Feature\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold text-emerald-400\",\"children\":\"TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"SmartAsset\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"className\":\"divide-y divide-border/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Paycheck calculator (50 states)\",{\"className\":\"bg-card/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Paycheck calculator (50 states)\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\",\"children\":\"✓\"}]}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-